{"id":"495163","name":"酱腌洋姜","author":"线线3896","authorId":"6038933","desc":"","cover":"images/495163/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"洋姜","amount":"500g"},{"name":"盐","amount":"2g"}],"sub":[{"name":"郫县豆瓣酱","amount":"40g"},{"name":"糖","amount":"10g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"洋姜清洗干净，晾干表面水分。","img":"images/495163/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"切成厚约3毫米的圆片，加入2g食盐搅拌均匀。","img":"images/495163/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放入漏筛中控去多余水分。中途上下颠簸一次。","img":"images/495163/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入40克豆瓣酱，10克白糖","img":"images/495163/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"用手揉搓3~5分钟。","img":"images/495163/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"装入密封瓶中，放入冰箱保存。隔天吃口感最好。","img":"images/495163/step_6.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：其他\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}